Maximum loss is 0.0050 (arXiv/512), 0.0046 (BGE/512) at $S=128$, and 0.0294 at $S=32$. FULL stays within 0.0006.

ArXiv/128 predicted/observed crossings are 0.965/0.984, 0.875/0.875, 0.620/0.625 at $S=32/64/128$ (\cref{fig:7-finite-pool}). The largest of 36 gaps is BGE/512: 0.144 (0.519/0.375). GT-loss prediction needs stable counts/held-out arm quality; calibration uses no labels.

